{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Change 3066 patch set 1 got LLM-Review -1 for 1 blocking issue, reported twice. Creates dispatched by `reroute_ordered_create_plans` ran neither the per-mutation lost-lease `abort_check()` nor the `_recheck_drift` HEAD re-check that the deleted `_apply_one` loop ran before each dispatch.\n\nPatch set 2 (c0ec7b420a3) fixes it:\n- `reroute_ordered_create_plans` takes a required `before_dispatch` callable and calls it just before each `_dispatch_with_backstop`.\n- `applier._apply_batch` passes `partial(_dispatch_checkpoint, abort_check, snapshot_head, repo_root, head_pin_cell)`. That new module-level helper runs `abort_check()`, then the HEAD re-check.\n- The create reroute is already inside the `HeadDriftError` try, so a drift there still emits the abort event and re-raises.\n\n2 new tests in `mutate/test_apply_list_of_mutations.py`:\n- `test_lost_lease_stops_the_create_reroute_before_any_vendor_call`;\n- `test_create_reroute_gates_every_create_dispatch`, which asserts the order abort_check → recheck → dispatch for each of 2 creates.\n\nGates on patch set 2:\n- complexity `new=0 increased=0`;\n- `applier.py` is 765 LOC;\n- `tests/unit/reconciler` plus `tests/integration/reconciler`: 3682 passed;\n- full `make verify` exited 0 (19699 passed, 86 skipped).\n\nThe 3 advisories are not changed:\n- `apply_phase` forwards `ticket_plans` only when set. The production path always sets it, and the plan puts that branch out of scope.\n- `_record_unrouted`'s leftover set includes a non-create action forced onto `LEGACY_ROUTE`. Only a test-only `overrides` map can do that, because every `MutationAction` other than create is in `NON_CREATE_FAMILIES`.\n- The third advisory duplicates the first."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792666857793816720,"uuid":"38965d4e-49a1-4aa0-a6c2-f2e51b2c34c6"}